  "description": "## What's New in v5.0.0\n\n### AIModels String Catalog\n- Provider-organized `AIModels` constants for direct string-based model selection\n- Supports exact provider model IDs and dated variants without enum-style usage in application code\n\n### Request-Scoped Runtime Control\n- Added `AIRequestProfile` for one-shot per-call overrides such as `Stateless`, `DisableFunctions`, `DisableReasoning`, `Temperature`, and `MaxTokens`\n- Added built-in presets via `RequestProfiles.QueryRewrite` and `RequestProfiles.Summarization`\n\n### Request-Scoped Prompt Composition\n- Added `AIRequestContext` with `SystemMessagePrefix`, `SystemMessageSuffix`, `RequestMessageOverride`, and `AdditionalMessages`\n\n### Static Stateless Helpers\n- Added `AIService.QuickAskAsync(...)`\n- Added `AIService.QuickAskWithImageAsync(...)`\n\n## Supported Models\n\n### OpenAI\n- GPT-5, GPT-5 Mini, GPT-5 Nano, GPT-5 Chat Latest\n- GPT-5.1\n- GPT-5.2, GPT-5.2 Pro, GPT-5.2 Codex\n- GPT-5.3 Codex\n- GPT-5.4, GPT-5.4 Pro\n- o3, o3-pro\n- GPT-4.1, GPT-4.1 Mini, GPT-4.1 Nano\n- GPT-4o, GPT-4o Mini, GPT-4 Vision\n\n### Anthropic Claude\n- Claude Opus 4.6, Opus 4.5, Opus 4.1, Opus 4\n- Claude Sonnet 4.6, Sonnet 4.5, Sonnet 4\n- Claude Haiku 4.5\n\n### xAI Grok\n- Grok 4, Grok 4.1 Fast\n- Grok 3, Grok 3 Mini\n\n### Google Gemini\n- Gemini 2.5 Pro, Flash, Flash-Lite\n- Gemini 3 Pro Preview, Flash Preview\n\n### DeepSeek\n- DeepSeek Chat, DeepSeek Reasoner\n\n### Perplexity\n- Sonar, Sonar Pro, Sonar Reasoning\n\n## Documentation\n- Basic Usage: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki\n- Advanced Features: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki/Advanced-Features\n- Release Notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki/Release-Notes\n- GitHub: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI",
